    "diagonal": "one column of a run of 3 or more 1-tile steps: the lip on the 45 degree line",
    "way": "the way up: 2 columns, landing row above the lip, the stair cut through lip and rock",
    "side": "side walls: the lip seen from above on the ring cell, the rock edge-on on the flank cell",
    "rim": "the back rim: a lit edge on the ring cell and a drop shade on the low cell north of it",
    "top": "the raised top, one level paler than the meadow"
